ed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_plan_dc8b6599bcd9940ba901", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_plan", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 3, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Independent expanded research scenario NB version 3.0.0. This is not a continuation of legacy Northstar NS; contract, cash and customer assumptions differ.", "text_sha256": "9d225433a95c28903c8f68929f3ef8c4737d81ce8e4b713cf3816ad4ecea3f93", "quote": "Independent expanded research scenario NB version 3.0.0. This is not a continuation of legacy Northstar NS; contract, cash and customer assumptions differ.", "start": 0, "end": 155, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_plan_33481e1cf22cdbae487f", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_plan", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 4, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "SYNTHETIC DATA. Management plan version 1 dated 2026-11-03. Forecasts are management assumptions, not signed orders. Revenue and delivery costs use calendar FY2027.", "text_sha256": "b8dda77f1a1c9160764e051341af4b3525a5604b8c7033fcda9d366c010077d6", "quote": "SYNTHETIC DATA. Management plan version 1 dated 2026-11-03. Forecasts are management assumptions, not signed orders. Revenue and delivery costs use calendar FY2027.", "start": 0, "end": 164, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_plan_c3ad87668a9d31923fa6", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_plan", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 5, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "The FY2027 plan comprises USD 1,200,000 from existing customers plus eight new deployments at USD 100,000 recognized revenue each, totaling USD 2,000,000. Cost of revenue is USD 600,000, operating expense USD 1,000,000 and EBITDA USD 400,000.", "text_sha256": "e8d17dee74bae8400f7fb4be49b0b5585df0b48c3b756c65b57233d8d9c98a09", "quote": "The FY2027 plan comprises USD 1,200,000 from existing customers plus eight new deployments at USD 100,000 recognized revenue each, totaling USD 2,000,000. Cost of revenue is USD 600,000, operating expense USD 1,000,000 and EBITDA USD 400,000.", "start": 0, "end": 242, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_plan_120fb150dc7a6815db4a", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_plan", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 6, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Two delivery squads can each complete two new deployments per year under the current staffing model, for four deployments. No signed outsourcing arrangement, approved hiring plan or faster delivery validation is provided.", "text_sha256": "aece28ae6ed19a36447f0edd62e67561bbaa511f9be588ffe915c00b925391bc", "quote": "Two delivery squads can each complete two new deployments per year under the current staffing model, for four deployments. No signed outsourcing arrangement, approved hiring plan or faster delivery validation is provided.", "start": 0, "end": 221, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_plan_0973a925a825e9e407ff", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_plan", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 7, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "The commercial plan counts eight new deployments while the signed headcount budget remains at two squads. A revised capacity forecast is requested but not supplied.", "text_sha256": "17faaf7bf82edfa291d74c90cb4fd2281abd5016bc599ba63d4ba6d64921178c", "quote": "The commercial plan counts eight new deployments while the signed headcount budget remains at two squads. A revised capacity forecast is requested but not supplied.", "start": 0, "end": 164, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_plan_f5ceec8e15195c673118", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_plan", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 8, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Recurring revenue from the two existing accounts is held flat in the forecast. The plan does not assume price increases for those accounts.", "text_sha256": "910984e6f8840dca2a4ce7b7e8bd06938ba46ff9a21bef4667b1fa581406e365", "quote": "Recurring revenue from the two existing accounts is held flat in the forecast. The plan does not assume price increases for those accounts.", "start": 0, "end": 139, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_plan_b147438c43ac95882ef9", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_plan", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_table_cell", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "table_index": 0, "row": 0, "column": 0, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Driver", "text_sha256": "9fe4c68ec20dda7c6b1d3f760e5e6af6b9802897cd59f084b99c68b2ac01574c", "quote": "Driver", "start": 0, "end": 6, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_plan_3d8228f2eff8d230174d", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_plan", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_table_cell", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "table_index": 0, "row": 0, "column": 1, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "FY2027", "text_sha256": "e98bbb643cc5877c2f4a9351b0690122d7b84ec1a1d47a384ef30cd3c705a184", "quo