aced by the commercial contract.", "text_sha256": "0f249fe5829a04f65af4706a67832eee9bdffc266887517bc96dd08ccfa0c884", "quote": "Aster and Northstar signed a commercial contract for annual subscription fees USD 240,000 and a one-time implementation fee USD 60,000. Total first-year contractual value is USD 300,000. The PoC memorandum has been replaced by the commercial contract.", "start": 0, "end": 251, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_cost_042780cc410d9ab53a97", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_cost", "document_version": 2, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 5, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "For Aster, annual subscription revenue USD 240,000 less cloud USD 84,000, inference USD 108,000 and recurring support USD 72,000 gives recurring contribution negative USD 24,000. Implementation revenue USD 60,000 less implementation labor USD 90,000 gives negative USD 30,000; full first-year contribution is negative USD 54,000.", "text_sha256": "4a976bd2f2b7f2808e8baac4e4a789a17f18991b3e99ffbde416efc587d400de", "quote": "For Aster, annual subscription revenue USD 240,000 less cloud USD 84,000, inference USD 108,000 and recurring support USD 72,000 gives recurring contribution negative USD 24,000. Implementation revenue USD 60,000 less implementation labor USD 90,000 gives negative USD 30,000; full first-year contribution is negative USD 54,000.", "start": 0, "end": 329, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_cost_070eaedc1d7f64a2fb26", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_cost", "document_version": 2, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 6, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "The original Aster estimate of USD 96,000 delivery cost omitted USD 108,000 inference and USD 60,000 incremental support allocation. The revised recurring cost total is USD 264,000. Initial and revised figures use different coverage, not an unexplained arithmetic discrepancy.", "text_sha256": "00926fa96107a937483a4cf32f142411f37ac399f626c5a1417dadccc7e6686f", "quote": "The original Aster estimate of USD 96,000 delivery cost omitted USD 108,000 inference and USD 60,000 incremental support allocation. The revised recurring cost total is USD 264,000. Initial and revised figures use different coverage, not an unexplained arithmetic discrepancy.", "start": 0, "end": 276, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_cost_0acb2036c99e4b640176", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_cost", "document_version": 2, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 8, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "The cost schedule explicitly includes implementation, cloud, inference and support categories. Customer-specific usage logs, time sheets and third-party invoice checks have not been provided; economic recovery remains unverified.", "text_sha256": "b6c75ac5c1202ddcf799d5008ca1a9bc5968acba917e7bb880b5b1834af59074", "quote": "The cost schedule explicitly includes implementation, cloud, inference and support categories. Customer-specific usage logs, time sheets and third-party invoice checks have not been provided; economic recovery remains unverified.", "start": 0, "end": 229, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_cost_0fe651c7a9ec487e38c6", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_cost", "document_version": 2, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 2, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Reporting period: Aster contract year 2026-12-01 through 2027-11-30", "text_sha256": "c53441863a52950b9dec80ae3d7f0120378