nt_id": "nb_doc_execution", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 6, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Invoice INV-01 dated 2026-11-12 is USD 120,000: implementation USD 60,000 and subscription prebilling USD 60,000. The invoice face amount is not recognized subscription revenue on that date.", "text_sha256": "f9010f730b5e7f141acd00ab006c2cf2f28b07f9a0aae8748f74de31c2ac2e81", "quote": "Invoice INV-01 dated 2026-11-12 is USD 120,000: implementation USD 60,000 and subscription prebilling USD 60,000. The invoice face amount is not recognized subscription revenue on that date.", "start": 0, "end": 190, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_execution_246e3310cfcfbfcd08db", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_execution", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 8, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "On acceptance USD 60,000 implementation revenue is recognized. Subscription revenue begins on 2026-12-01. The remaining USD 60,000 of invoicing is deferred revenue at 2026-11-12.", "text_sha256": "5ebc0f7f39b12ebe2cc2c6b3cbe6df1b9576664cf7d0df97c90d9347f4e039bd", "quote": "On acceptance USD 60,000 implementation revenue is recognized. Subscription revenue begins on 2026-12-01. The remaining USD 60,000 of invoicing is deferred revenue at 2026-11-12.", "start": 0, "end": 178, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_execution_24b4ef7826cd0ed1f7a3", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_execution", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 2, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Reporting period: 2026-11-12", "text_sha256": "5f51c4f40ca9f309ab79296e253daeb1141b2981fcf234525bf8eabc6378848b", "quote": "Reporting period: 2026-11-12", "start": 0, "end": 28, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_execution_5be6dab6279e9c415434", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_execution", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 7, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Remittance RC-01 matched to INV-01 records USD 90,000 cash received on 2026-11-12. USD 30,000 remains outstanding; neither full collection nor an overdue balance is asserted.", "text_sha256": "6fbe0f67ba0ca8a1ef3ae654c90676159449b364da83329264dea86376986361", "quote": "Remittance RC-01 matched to INV-01 records USD 90,000 cash received on 2026-11-12. USD 30,000 remains outstanding; neither full collection nor an overdue balance is asserted.", "start": 0, "end": 174, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_execution_933a2ed4aaf7140b6d87", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_execution", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 4, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "SYNTHETIC DATA. Simulated acceptance, invoice and bank remittance extracts. No actual customer or bank records are used.", "text_sha256": "4b3ffb11f4e91f84ce1f1bb4c78ec75131db8e0e915a6fe491342d9db60f8696", "quote": "SYNTHETIC DATA. Simulated acceptance, invoice and bank remittance extracts. No actual customer or bank records are used.", "start": 0, "end": 120, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_execution_b4c4ed1839ad72d889c0", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_execution", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 3, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Independent expanded research scenario NB version 3.0.0. This is not a continuation of legacy Northstar NS; contract, cash and customer assumptions differ.", "text_sha256": "9d225433a95c28903c8f68929f3ef8c4737d81ce8e4b713cf3816ad4ecea3f93", "quote": "Independent expanded research scenario NB version 3.0.0. This is not a continuation of legacy Northstar NS; contract, cash and customer assumptions differ.", "start": 0, "end": 155, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_execution_d23e913eee77e84dac0a", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_execution", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Northstar Aster Deployment Billing and Collection Evidence", "text_sha256": "c6682d2a936f4609941d153982febf613c95faea36a988388018955ddedf6544", "quote": "Northstar Aster Deployment Billing and Collection Evidence", "start": 0, "end": 58, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_execution_eb8e02d0beb8dac0ad88", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_execution", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 9, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "No new Birch contract or customer ownership confirmation is included. Aster acceptance and cash evidence must not be extrapolated to Birch.", "text_sha256": "6ad7c8120718e707c579a869af813eb560f00c0372c976377d699a8fdf08b348", "quote": "No new Birch contract or customer ownership confirmation is included. Aster acceptance and cash evidence must not be extrapolated to Birch.", "start": 0, "end": 139, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_execution_f59d61137dc13723100b", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_execution", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 5, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Aster signed acceptance certificate AC-01 on 2026-11-12 after all contractual benchmark tests passed. Deployment status is accepted; this certificate covers Aster only.", "text_sha256": "6b1c76286039c386c04135287b5b00285a1ae992562cb6790b2f4f2dae82ff6d", "quote": "Aster signed acceptance certificate AC-01 on 2026-11-12 after all contractual benchmark tests passed. Deployment status is accepted; this certificate covers Aster only.", "start": 0, "end": 168, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_financial_04e67664538f99362046", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_financial", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 7, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "FY2025 cash increased by USD 150,000: cash from operations USD 110,000, CAPEX USD 80,000, new debt USD 50,000 and new equity USD 70,000. Opening cash USD 300,000 and closing cash USD 450,000.", "text_sha256": "b5e044fc5a9169066bb4c043f68e382bd34ab3f483de8cefc3cc86c084664d09", "quote": "FY2025 cash increased by USD 150,000: cash from operations USD 110,000, CAPEX USD 80,000, new debt USD 50,000 and new equity USD 70,000. Opening cash USD 300,000 and closing cash USD 450,000.", "start": 0, "end": 191, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_financial_069f4f9ece310f277c13", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_financial", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_table_cell", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "table_index": 1, "row": 0, "column": 2, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "FY2025", "text_sha256": "6d3bcb4900a2e15a723c382e24be