 commercial plan counts eight new deployments while the signed headcount budget remains at two squads. A revised capacity forecast is requested but not supplied.", "text_sha256": "17faaf7bf82edfa291d74c90cb4fd2281abd5016bc599ba63d4ba6d64921178c", "quote": "The commercial plan counts eight new deployments while the signed headcount budget remains at two squads. A revised capacity forecast is requested but not supplied.", "start": 0, "end": 164, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_plan_120fb150dc7a6815db4a", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_plan", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 6, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Two delivery squads can each complete two new deployments per year under the current staffing model, for four deployments. No signed outsourcing arrangement, approved hiring plan or faster delivery validation is provided.", "text_sha256": "aece28ae6ed19a36447f0edd62e67561bbaa511f9be588ffe915c00b925391bc", "quote": "Two delivery squads can each complete two new deployments per year under the current staffing model, for four deployments. No signed outsourcing arrangement, approved hiring plan or faster delivery validation is provided.", "start": 0, "end": 221, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_plan_16599cc36c4c2a597952", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_plan", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_table_cell", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "table_index": 0, "row": 7, "column": 0, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Current capacity deployments", "text_sha256": "7116459c0cdbad2be885fcfddac648fcd63359795895429fdec9b515d6aeb0c7", "quote": "Current capacity deployments", "start": 0, "end": 28, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id