 "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 5, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "The FY2027 plan comprises USD 1,200,000 from existing customers plus eight new deployments at USD 100,000 recognized revenue each, totaling USD 2,000,000. Cost of revenue is USD 600,000, operating expense USD 1,000,000 and EBITDA USD 400,000.", "text_sha256": "e8d17dee74bae8400f7fb4be49b0b5585df0b48c3b756c65b57233d8d9c98a09", "quote": "The FY2027 plan comprises USD 1,200,000 from existing customers plus eight new deployments at USD 100,000 recognized revenue each, totaling USD 2,000,000. Cost of revenue is USD 600,000, operating expense USD 1,000,000 and EBITDA USD 400,000.", "start": 0, "end": 242, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_plan_dc8b6599bcd9940ba901", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_plan", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 3, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Independent expanded research scenario NB version 3.0.0. This is not a continuation of legacy Northstar NS; contract, cash and customer assumptions differ.", "text_sha256": "9d225433a95c28903c8f68929f3ef8c4737d81ce8e4b713cf3816ad4ecea3f93", "quote": "Independent expanded research scenario NB version 3.0.0. This is not a continuation of legacy Northstar NS; contract, cash and customer assumptions differ.", "start": 0, "end": 155, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_plan_e032e9070ae553186173", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_plan", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_table_cell", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "table_index": 0, "row": 3, "column": 1, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "100000", "text_sha256": "3bb78535cc9555ff19fe3556aaa41c78a0a45c64d49ba2bc564507648a8e