d08836e9f9635625c5ce9711153ce9a8909fbe137014c093f089af0", "parse_status": "parsed", "parser_version": "orion-native-1.0.0", "source_origin": "company", "origin_key": "nb_doc_plan", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z"}], "source_spans": [{"id": "span_nb_doc_cim_09e831ba10bb0d820827", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_cim", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 1, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "SYNTHETIC | nb_doc_cim | 2026-11-03 | Version 1", "text_sha256": "b067e9caa14f1eeac7541df432d4df7a6b415e04f8ee161ced92968f24f2184c", "quote": "SYNTHETIC | nb_doc_cim | 2026-11-03 | Version 1", "start": 0, "end": 47, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_cim_1222723f4a487ac339f2", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_cim", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 3, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Independent expanded research scenario NB version 3.0.0. This is not a continuation of legacy Northstar NS; contract, cash and customer assumptions differ.", "text_sha256": "9d225433a95c28903c8f68929f3ef8c4737d81ce8e4b713cf3816ad4ecea3f93", "quote": "Independent expanded research scenario NB version 3.0.0. This is not a continuation of legacy Northstar NS; contract, cash and customer assumptions differ.", "start": 0, "end": 155, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_cim_245c0cf8f3c01eefeb56", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_cim", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 5, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Management reports four enterprise customers and committed annual recurring revenue of USD 1,800,000: Quartz USD 720,000, Vale USD 480,000, Aster USD 240,000 and Birch USD 360,000.", "text_sha256": "a40e26e24c39310271d37087f4ca35ec6f34486fd1d700286cd1b9ff1af7e3db", "quote": "Management reports four enterprise customers and committed annual recurring revenue of USD 1,800,000: Quartz USD 720,000, Vale USD 480,000, Aster USD 240,000 and Birch USD 360,000.", "start": 0, "end": 180, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_cim_629a97ee93af25505e17", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_cim", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 7, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Management estimates Aster annual subscription revenue of USD 240,000 and annual delivery costs of USD 96,000, giving positive contribution of USD 144,000. Implementation effort and incremental inference usage have not been costed.", "text_sha256": "4c06a660098198dc9c7c7b7ce9a0baefcce5a2f807b05b4c5b3e80c8ef8b5581", "quote": "Management estimates Aster annual subscription revenue of USD 240,000 and annual delivery costs of USD 96,000, giving positive contribution of USD 144,000. Implementation effort and incremental inference usage have not been costed.", "start": 0, "end": 231, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_cim_83030ce229421813a642", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_cim", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 2, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Reporting period: FY2025 and FY2027 plan", "text_sha256": "3798b4d91139c8889add8f7b8248c57b573eb34d9b0fa77cef11dd6f5f9b5b1f", "quote": "Reporting period: FY2025 and FY2027 plan", "start": 0, "end": 40, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_cim_8ffc1ee35e5c32fb6b43", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_cim", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 4, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "SYNTHETIC DATA. Fictional CIM for academic preliminary investment screening. All names, customers, amounts and documents are invented. This is management reporting, not an independently verified investment conclusion.", "text_sha256": "857dcae6564bf6b59876454035da5e3df2a4457ee1f25e28ad5a06cfa3a9bf3a", "quote": "SYNTHETIC DATA. Fictional CIM for academic preliminary investment screening. All names, customers, amounts and documents are invented. This is management reporting, not an independently verified investment conclusion.", "start": 0, "end": 217, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_cim_95be9cc3097b8991be39", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_cim", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Northstar Analytics Investment Overview", "text_sha256": "05a02ad58f6705e3552da9c2b9d6efab428188dddb18272bff9b6c86f6e19144", "quote": "Northstar Analytics Investment Overview", "start": 0, "end": 39, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_cim_af4edbeaec54b557691b", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_cim", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 6, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "FY2025 revenue was USD 1,200,000 and reported gross profit was USD 840,000, a 70% gross margin. The presentation includes only cloud hosting and routine support within cost of revenue.", "text_sha256": "8b45edf58eb760b11bf488d03033d4b49549286e015fdcb4dc12c0ae5fa33dd5", "quote": "FY2025 revenue was USD 1,200,000 and reported gross profit was USD 840,000, a 70% gross margin. The presentation includes only cloud hosting and routine support within cost of revenue.", "start": 0, "end": 184, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_cim_d288ec2dd44035785cdb", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_cim", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 9, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "No customer ownership certificates, source-level inference logs or reconciled customer contribution schedules are attached. Management expects two new paying enterprise deployments by October 2027.", "text_sha256": "d2874eba60332c12883d8a6c158731633b518ec5c26da387633f7f735918da3e", "quote": "No customer ownership certificates, source-level inference logs or reconciled customer contribution schedules are attached. Management expects two new paying enterprise deployments by October 2027.", "start": 0, "end": 197, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_cim_e614ade6231ab676f2fc", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_cim", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 8, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Quartz and Vale renewed their support subscriptions during FY2025. The delivery team retained the same four senior engineers throughout the year. Product use remains concentrated in document analytics.", "text_sha256": "c23250ea9de2115cce7aebb11d410664776e76a951ef4252ea49e45f47ccf7ec", "quote": "Quartz and Vale renewed their support subscriptions during FY2025. The delivery team retained the same four senior engineers throughout the year. Product use remains concentrated in document analytics.", "start": 0, "end": 201, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_contract_1eefc78bcc7e78597b91", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_contract", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 6, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Acceptance requires an agreed benchmark test and a customer acceptance certificate. The first invoice is USD 120,000 comprising USD 60,000 implementation plus USD 60,000 for the first subscription quarter.", "text_sha256": "bd3b16e74c7ba2e02ef3fe114098398ed2f86fb0791bb36ee271a0e8ed6769ca", "quote": "Acceptance requires an agreed benchmark test and a customer acceptance certificate. The first invoice is USD 120,000 comprising USD 60,000 implementation plus USD 60,000 for the first subscription quarter.", "start": 0, "end": 205, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_contract_516beb44dbd6edb0b111", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_contract", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 8, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Birch remains at nonbinding letter-of-interest stage as of 2026-11-05.", "text_sha256": "2d490231caca3ef88477ccb48bddcca7acd80f30f6748ef761a56f9f0b75b537", "quote": "Birch remains at nonbinding letter-of-interest stage as of 2026-11-05.", "start": 0, "end": 70, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_contract_72f9ee6358d3143131b1", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_contract", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 1, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "SYNTHETIC | nb_doc_contract | 2026-11-05 | Version 1", "text_sha256": "7878a6e0cad369e1668495795d7d0377367350f455f4f241958ec2037024f267", "quote": "SYNTHETIC | nb_doc_contract | 2026-11-05 | Version 1", "start": 0, "end": 52, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_contract_b7ed5376438f4484ae5d", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_contract", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Northstar Aster Commercial Contract and PoC Schedule", "text_sha256": "82e4abb32601dfb46566b1cc072ab561015108bfd29363be9bd5fb8ad529cc0d", "quote": "Northstar Aster Commercial Contract and PoC Schedule", "start": 0, "end": 52, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_contract_bd4d85c2319462a8e379", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_contract", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 7, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "This exhibit contains no acceptance certificate, issued invoice or bank receipt. A signature alone does not demonstrate recognized revenue, completed acceptance or collection.", "text_sha256": "c8ee22b2d7b7c86fdaddadb8006cb1d7366c971555a7689f98833f7a097607f6", "quote": "This exhibit contains no acceptance certificate, issued invoice or bank receipt. A signature alone does not demonstrate recognized revenue, completed acceptance or collection.", "start": 0, "end": 175, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_contract_ea891a649907d65dd846", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_contract", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 2, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Reporting period: 2026-12-01 through 2027-11-30", "text_sha256": "2b6eb6d61417577ce494b8baaa39ba2adc754d7f85afcf4c1110dd165e862761", "quote": "Reporting period: 2026-12-01 through 2027-11-30", "start": 0, "end": 47, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_contract_ec345ac147c70f0beabf", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_contract", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 3, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Independent expanded research scenario NB version 3.0.0. This is not a continuation of legacy Northstar NS; contract, cash and customer assumptions differ.", "text_sha256": "9d225433a95c28903c8f68929f3ef8c4737d81ce8e4b713cf3816ad4ecea3f93", "quote": "Independent expanded research scenario NB version 3.0.0. This is not a continuation of legacy Northstar NS; contract, cash and customer assumptions differ.", "start": 0, "end": 155, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_contract_f3be2a099c8bece52ec4", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_contract", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 4, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "SYNTHETIC DATA. Simulated counterparty contract exhibit, not an authentic third-party document. Executed on 2026-11-05; service term 2026-12-01 through 2027-11-30.", "text_sha256": "b6ad2d684a0fe2ddb0c0a5456bac1b315e7b8e4e50bd09977bd29354bcb3055f", "quote": "SYNTHETIC DATA. Simulated counterparty contract exhibit, not an authentic third-party document. Executed on 2026-11-05; service term 2026-12-01 through 2027-11-30.", "start": 0, "end": 163, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_contract_f7bb30b09636e461e95b", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_contract", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 5, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Aster and Northstar signed a commercial contract for annual subscription fees USD 240,000 and a one-time implementation fee USD 60,000. Total first-year contractual value is USD 300,000. The PoC memorandum has been replaced by the commercial contract.", "text_sha256": "0f249fe5829a04f65af4706a67832eee9bdffc266887517bc96dd08ccfa0c884", "quote": "Aster and Northstar signed a commercial contract for annual subscription fees USD 240,000 and a one-time implementation fee USD 60,000. Total first-year contractual value is USD 300,000. The PoC memorandum has been replaced by the commercial contract.", "start": 0, "end": 251, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_cost_042780cc410d9ab53a97", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_cost", "document_version": 2, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 5, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "For Aster, annual subscription revenue USD 240,000 less cloud USD 84,000, inference USD 108,000 and recurring support USD 72,000 gives recurring contribution negative USD 24,000. Implementation revenue USD 60,000 less implementation labor USD 90,000 gives negative USD 30,000; full first-year contribution is negative USD 54,000.", "text_sha256": "4a976bd2f2b7f2808e8baac4e4a789a17f18991b3e99ffbde416efc587d400de", "quote": "For Aster, annual subscription revenue USD 240,000 less cloud USD 84,000, inference USD 108,000 and recurring support USD 72,000 gives recurring contribution negative USD 24,000. Implementation revenue USD 60,000 less implementation labor USD 90,000 gives negative USD 30,000; full first-year contribution is negative USD 54,000.", "start": 0, "end": 329, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_cost_070eaedc1d7f64a2fb26", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_cost", "document_version": 2, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 6, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "The original Aster estimate of USD 96,000 delivery cost omitted USD 108,000 inference and USD 60,000 incremental support allocation. The revised recurring cost total is USD 264,000. Initial and revised figures use different coverage, not an unexplained arithmetic discrepancy.", "text_sha256": "00926fa96107a937483a4cf32f142411f37ac399f626c5a1417dadccc7e6686f", "quote": "The original Aster estimate of USD 96,000 delivery cost omitted USD 108,000 inference and USD 60,000 incremental support allocation. The revised recurring cost total is USD 264,000. Initial and revised figures use different coverage, not an unexplained arithmetic discrepancy.", "start": 0, "end": 276, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_cost_0acb2036c99e4b640176", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_cost", "document_version": 2, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 8, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "The cost schedule explicitly includes implementation, cloud, inference and support categories. Customer-specific usage logs, time sheets and third-party invoice checks have not been provided; economic recovery remains unverified.", "text_sha256": "b6c75ac5c1202ddcf799d5008ca1a9bc5968acba917e7bb880b5b1834af59074", "quote": "The cost schedule explicitly includes implementation, cloud, inference and support categories. Customer-specific usage logs, time sheets and third-party invoice checks have not been provided; economic recovery remains unverified.", "start": 0, "end": 229, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_cost_0fe651c7a9ec487e38c6", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_cost", "d