 of interest, no executed contract and no deployment.", "text_sha256": "8066cdde7dd80cb1f65a8dbbd35fda1a5cd042e25fc22444b0bc488066de4f7a", "quote": "Quartz and Vale are existing paying customers. Aster has a completed technical proof of concept but no executed commercial contract in the supplied pack. Birch has a nonbinding letter of interest, no executed contract and no deployment.", "start": 0, "end": 236, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_crm_b431a4ac508a6f2325ee", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_crm", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_table_cell", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "table_index": 0, "row": 0, "column": 2, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Annual value USD", "text_sha256": "8cd0175fd22bbbe6bfb862ae6aeb460be056878491869d4630ea422d720e1dfa", "quote": "Annual value USD", "start": 0, "end": 16, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_crm_c5dc2d59afbb174857ba", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_crm", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 6, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Management labels the Aster USD 240,000 and Birch USD 360,000 pipeline opportunities as committed ARR in the CIM. Under this CRM snapshot they remain unsigned opportunities and are not committed recurring contract revenue.", "text_sha256": "e21d8479a30fd7d9b80bf6ee1541030f48e8dfe6502637c97ef01e5df87b54e9", "quote": "Management labels the Aster USD 240,000 and Birch USD 360,000 pipeline opportunities as committed ARR in the CIM. Under this CRM snapshot they remain unsigned opportunities and are not committed recurring contract revenue.", "start": 0, "end": 222, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_crm_caa3fa6bc79e3f1c15a2", "entity_version": 1