84f01f8840457c197508573e9e7451e73ef7", "quote": "SYNTHETIC | nb_doc_execution | 2026-11-12 | Version 1", "start": 0, "end": 53, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_execution_08bd0bc9c0b18a6cd062", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_execution", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 6, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Invoice INV-01 dated 2026-11-12 is USD 120,000: implementation USD 60,000 and subscription prebilling USD 60,000. The invoice face amount is not recognized subscription revenue on that date.", "text_sha256": "f9010f730b5e7f141acd00ab006c2cf2f28b07f9a0aae8748f74de31c2ac2e81", "quote": "Invoice INV-01 dated 2026-11-12 is USD 120,000: implementation USD 60,000 and subscription prebilling USD 60,000. The invoice face amount is not recognized subscription revenue on that date.", "start": 0, "end": 190, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_execution_246e3310cfcfbfcd08db", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_execution", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 8, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "On acceptance USD 60,000 implementation revenue is recognized. Subscription revenue begins on 2026-12-01. The remaining USD 60,000 of invoicing is deferred revenue at 2026-11-12.", "text_sha256": "5ebc0f7f39b12ebe2cc2c6b3cbe6df1b9576664cf7d0df97c90d9347f4e039bd", "quote": "On acceptance USD 60,000 implementation revenue is recognized. Subscription revenue begins on 2026-12-01. The remaining USD 60,000 of invoicing is deferred revenue at 2026-11-12.", "start": 0, "end": 178, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_execution_24b4ef7826cd0ed1f7a3", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "dea