e": "Management has not produced an additional independently controlled new customer, Aster remaining cash receipt, or a supported eight-deployment capacity plan.", "start": 0, "end": 157, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_followup_253810a57277a108d332", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_followup", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 6, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "The simulated ownership registry states that Birch is wholly owned by Aster. These two legal counterparties therefore do not establish two independently controlled customer groups.", "text_sha256": "04f212107f9264744685ab09784666d4e90e212dc973184e44683cf220d9e526", "quote": "The simulated ownership registry states that Birch is wholly owned by Aster. These two legal counterparties therefore do not establish two independently controlled customer groups.", "start": 0, "end": 180, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_followup_3aab871ef6b23c7e8e08", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_followup", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 3, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Independent expanded research scenario NB version 3.0.0. This is not a continuation of legacy Northstar NS; contract, cash and customer assumptions differ.", "text_sha256": "9d225433a95c28903c8f68929f3ef8c4737d81ce8e4b713cf3816ad4ecea3f93", "quote": "Independent expanded research scenario NB version 3.0.0. This is not a continuation of legacy Northstar NS; contract, cash and customer assumptions differ.", "start": 0, "end": 155, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_followup_4351215d6c0ac495a5be", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_followup", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 5, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Birch signed an annual subscription contract for USD 360,000 on 2026-11-22. Its acceptance certificate dated 2026-11-25 records benchmark completion; the first USD 90,000 quarterly invoice was paid in full on that date.", "text_sha256": "2b1285f25fd8d80ed85dbd4fd8f5365851451ff99155d978e14b96885c97c8b0", "quote": "Birch signed an annual subscription contract for USD 360,000 on 2026-11-22. Its acceptance certificate dated 2026-11-25 records benchmark completion; the first USD 90,000 quarterly invoice was paid in full on that date.", "start": 0, "end": 219, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_followup_48f276d361cb3be6e573", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_followup", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 4, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "SYNTHETIC DATA. Fictional follow-up management response with simulated contract, acceptance and ownership extracts dated 2026-11-25.", "text_sha256": "f38606adf36c86322abb4c087a6cee8e89f7bf328afef4a52471c11aea5bba5e", "quote": "SYNTHETIC DATA. Fictional follow-up management response with simulated contract, acceptance and ownership extracts dated 2026-11-25.", "start": 0, "end": 132, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_followup_50e8ad46fb12f834f987", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_followup", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 8, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "No revised pricing agreement, inference-usage reduction or independently verified customer cost reduction is sup