03 there were two paying customers, one PoC and one unsigned prospect. On 2026-11-25 Aster and Birch have paid contracts but form one control group.", "text_sha256": "3591126dfd262bed4d31df98e7b3eb1dd0621aa65d4cf50831739714780e2fe4", "quote": "Management corrects the initial customer taxonomy: on 2026-11-03 there were two paying customers, one PoC and one unsigned prospect. On 2026-11-25 Aster and Birch have paid contracts but form one control group.", "start": 0, "end": 210, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_followup_f50d3ef400d1f628297b", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_followup", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Northstar Follow Up Commercial and Ownership Evidence", "text_sha256": "8ad6b654d96f6634ef78d985d5b4ee8fc945f61550170b6bb0ecda99f385f577", "quote": "Northstar Follow Up Commercial and Ownership Evidence", "start": 0, "end": 53, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_plan_0073749cefa2400096b9", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_plan", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_table_cell", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "table_index": 0, "row": 6, "column": 0, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Deployments per squad", "text_sha256": "2b09b09431f24dfdc5124e1b71fcf31181314512ebfd919bc1b05e630c54a2f1", "quote": "Deployments per squad", "start": 0, "end": 21, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_nb_doc_plan_0973a925a825e9e407ff", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_nb", "document_id": "nb_doc_plan", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 7, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "The commercial pla